title: "Horizon Equilibrium Network (HEN): A Steady-State Peer-to-Peer Value Ledger (衡远网络)"
abstract: "A non-normative research draft describing a hypothetical decentralized ledger framework that keeps permissionless participation, public verifiability and peer-to-peer transfer, while exploring bounded energy cost, convergent incentives, native shielding, bounded parameter auto-tuning and backwards-compatible upgrades. The project issues no token and operates no network."
